\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Performance Optimization\par
COMMENT:  Fabric improves performance automatically through built-in optimizations like query acceleration, caching, and reduced data scanning. Some bottlenecks still come from source systems or configuration choices. For more complex or high-volume workloads fine-tuning is necessary. \par
LINKS:\par
{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/project/query-acceleration-for-data-lakes/ }}{\fldrslt{https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/project/query-acceleration-for-data-lakes/\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
