\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Encryption\par
COMMENT:  All data in Fabric is automatically encrypted automatically while moving and while stored. Organizations can add their own keys for more control using Azure Key Vault for additional control over key management.\par
