{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/security/security-fundamentals }}{\fldrslt{https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/security/security-fundamentals\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
