\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  RBAC\par
COMMENT:  Fabric workspace roles control who can view, edit, or manage resources.  In addition, role integrate with Azure Active Directory for centralized identity management. Granular permissions for items allow precise control over specific datasets, pipelines, and reports.\par
LINKS:\par
{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/get-started/roles-workspaces }}{\fldrslt{https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/get-started/roles-workspaces\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
