\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  ABAC\par
COMMENT:  Fabric permissions are mostly role-based.  Some attribute-style controls are available through surrounding Microsoft security services.  For example row-level security in reports provides limited attribute filtering for specific consumption scenarios. But comprehensive attribute-based authorization requires custom development.\par
LINKS:\par
{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/enterprise/service-admin-rls }}{\fldrslt{https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/enterprise/service-admin-rls\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
