\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  NIST Compliance\par
COMMENT:  Fabric has strong baseline security features (like encryption, identity controls, and auditing hooks) that support NIST-aligned implementations.  These security features align well with common NIST expectations when used in the right Azure environment.  But actual compliance is not automatic and depends on configuration and controls.\par
LINKS:\par
{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/compliance/offerings/offering-nist-800-53 }}{\fldrslt{https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/compliance/offerings/offering-nist-800-53\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
