\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA: FISMA / FedRAMP Compliance\par
COMMENT:  Deployment on Azure Government cloud infrastructure with FedRAMP High authorization supports federal agency requirements. Organizations must use authorized government regions and maintain proper security configurations.\par
LINKS:\par
{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/compliance/offerings/offering-fedramp }}{\fldrslt{https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/compliance/offerings/offering-fedramp\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
