\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Specialized Workflow Support\par
COMMENT:  Fabric is a flexible tool for orchestrating complex workflows.  The service enables complex batch workflows for moving and transforming data. Dynamic execution using variables and expressions allows workflows to adapt based on runtime conditions and metadata.\par
LINKS:\par
{{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/data-factory/pipeline-overview }}{\fldrslt{https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/data-factory/pipeline-overview\ul0\cf0}}}}\f0\fs22\par
