\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Automation\par
COMMENT:  Fabric offers end-to-end, comprehensive automation of routine tasks and infrastructure deployment. Pipelines can be triggered programmatically and integrated with CI/CD tools. It features the use of scheduled pipeline execution, event-driven triggers, and REST APIs.  \par
