\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Monitoring & Alerting\par
COMMENT:  Fabric provides built-in, centralized views to see job success and to review run history. While this works well for basic oversight, more advanced alerting and end-to-end monitoring usually require extra setup or integration with external tools\par
