\par
DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Intuitive Interface\par
COMMENT:  Fabric has a consolidated interface that can tailored to different roles. Visual design tools with drag-and-drop functionality make common tasks accessible without heavy coding.  However, related work is spread across multiple areas of the platform.  So, users often have to context-switch between different screens for different tasks.\par
