SUBCRITERIA:  Deployment Automatable\par
COMMENT:  Automated deployment is supported through APIs and DevOps-style release workflows, which makes repeatable rollouts achievable. Full IaC support is still evolving and Terraform or ARM-template approaches are not yet fully baked. Manual setup is still part of the package.\par
