DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Support for Different Configuration Languages\par
COMMENT:  Fabric configuration is managed through structured definitions and APIs that rely on JSON. YAML-based configuration or standard IaC languages are not natively supported.  This forces teams to work with proprietary JSON formats rather than the normal cloud provisioning languages and approaches.  \par
