SUBCRITERIA:  High Availability (HA)\par
COMMENT:  High availability is built into the Fabric service.  Azure's multi-zone architecture automatically handles failover during infrastructure failures. Data replication across multiple locations protects against loss. All redundancy configuration is part of the service.\par
