DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Distributed Support\par
COMMENT:  Large batch loads run across distributed resources in Microsoft Fabric.  Processing is automatically distributed across multiple compute nodes using parallel execution.  Multi-region deployment supports geographically distributed workloads. But, to note, cross-region data access does introduce latency and data egress costs.  Capacity planning is still required for consistent results.\par
