DATA PRODUCT:  Microsoft Fabric\par
SUBCRITERIA:  Zero-Down Time Maintenance\par
COMMENT:  Most platform updates roll out gradually without service interruptions using Microsoft's managed maintenance approach. Some situations may cause brief impacts to specific services and long-running jobs might require restarts during underlying system updates.  Full end-to-end zero downtime is not guaranteed, especially when gateways are involved.\par
